    "body": "Addressed: prepared the requested merge of current main locally. Validation blocks the push.\n\nLocal merge: 84c6c67584d2b1542e287fe6e239a1f38545f67b.\nMain: fe385c6427065ba28ece74c9d5f2859f481bc81e.\n\nThe Wire Contour page keeps the overlap controls and help text. It also keeps main's shared start-hole editor. Two new test fixtures use the default overlap value.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: RED. Of 708 planned steps, 4 passed, 1 failed, and 703 were skipped. Simulation and motion tests passed. The closing-overlap, centre-slit, and skim-law pins passed.\n\nThe app build fails with E0063 at `crates/app/tests/mcp_wire_contour.rs:269`. Its `WireContourDto` initializer lacks `overlap`. Clippy on app, motion, sim, and UI fails with the same error.\n\nThat test requires non-default values. Adding the field also requires matching entries in `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs` and `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`. These changes exceed this run's merge-only scope. I stopped without a push.\n\nThe contributor's branch and PR state are unchanged. The local merge remains in `.claude/worktrees/fix-3617`.\n",
