    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T05:00:30Z",
    "body": "Addressed: merged current main (no rebase, no force-push), fixed the `WireContourDto` initializer with a non-default overlap of 1.5 mm, and added the matching `crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs` entry and the one-line `camcraft-mcp` SKILL.md entry. The merge also seeded `overlap: 0.0` into the three initializers that main's merge brought in (`commands/operation/create.rs`, `agie_native.rs`, `g_edm_post.rs`), all at the default. The merge resolution keeps the overlap controls and help text, and takes main's shared start-hole editor.\n\nSuites:\n- `camcraft-app`: `mcp_wire_contour`, `golden_cl`, `setup_align_non_mill`, `sodick_*` (4) and every wire suite (23 binaries) - all pass.\n- `camcraft-motion`: lib (597) and `wire_fans` - pass.\n- `camcraft-sim`: lib (241) - pass.\n- `camcraft-ui`: lib (1544) - pass.\n- clippy on app, motion, sim and ui, `-D warnings` - clean.\n\nThe branch stays a draft for its first review.\r\n",
